WEBVTT

00:08.842 --> 00:16.883
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.883 --> 00:24.881
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.399 --> 00:36.202
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.202 --> 00:39.205
Believing, dreaming

00:39.205 --> 00:43.043
We are searching

00:43.043 --> 00:48.174
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.983 --> 00:58.391
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.391 --> 01:02.962
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.962 --> 01:05.632
Ah, surely someday

01:05.632 --> 01:13.907
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.907 --> 01:18.867
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.413 --> 01:27.046
Let's begin our journey

01:31.224 --> 01:32.392
FISH

01:32.392 --> 01:33.693
FISH
Give me a discount!

01:33.693 --> 01:34.360
Give me a discount!

01:34.360 --> 01:35.762
I can't do that.

01:35.762 --> 01:37.097
Just a little!

01:37.097 --> 01:38.223
Forget it!

01:38.598 --> 01:40.361
Come on, you're the boss!

01:41.801 --> 01:45.396
I'm just no match for your
shopping savvy, Frey.

01:45.805 --> 01:47.240
Go ahead and take it.

01:47.240 --> 01:48.867
Thanks as always!

01:49.142 --> 01:52.112
Heimdall! We're having grilled
salted mackerel tonight!

01:52.112 --> 01:55.411
I'll take it easy on the salt, so it
doesn't raise our blood pressure.

01:57.684 --> 01:59.919
It's the classic Japanese beauty!

01:59.919 --> 02:01.216
Hold this!

02:02.021 --> 02:03.045
Hey!

02:03.690 --> 02:04.588
Jeez.

02:09.129 --> 02:10.596
Oh, my classic Japanese beauty.

02:11.431 --> 02:13.592
Fate has brought us together once again.

02:14.267 --> 02:15.894
Mr. Thief...

02:17.270 --> 02:18.498
What's the matter?

02:19.539 --> 02:22.736
Mr. Thief, what should I do?

02:27.380 --> 02:33.012
The 11th Night
Transfer Student in Love

02:41.327 --> 02:46.026
They're going to disband
the Mystery Society?

02:49.802 --> 02:50.928
What?!

02:51.237 --> 02:54.673
As head of the Student Council,
allow me to put it bluntly.

02:55.408 --> 02:58.378
Given the present situation,
I cannot possibly approve of

02:58.378 --> 03:01.176
the Mystery Society continuing
to operate as a club.

03:01.614 --> 03:04.684
I'll do my best to stay active from now on!

03:04.684 --> 03:06.982
I'm tired of hearing that old excuse.

03:07.787 --> 03:08.913
Please!

03:09.756 --> 03:11.257
Daidoji...

03:11.257 --> 03:15.694
Lately you've been going home right
after school, isn't that right?

03:16.663 --> 03:18.698
Uh, well that's because...

03:18.698 --> 03:21.428
Because I've been going over to Loki's.

03:22.168 --> 03:25.467
I will not allot a budget for a club
that exists only in name.

03:25.705 --> 03:28.141
My point is you're the only member!

03:28.141 --> 03:30.166
It's a total waste of a club room!

03:30.476 --> 03:32.444
You think you could overlook that part?

03:32.645 --> 03:35.048
At the next student council meeting,

03:35.048 --> 03:37.846
I'm going to move that we dissolve
the Mystery Society!

03:38.451 --> 03:39.645
What?!

03:43.957 --> 03:45.758
That's awful!

03:45.758 --> 03:49.057
I won't tolerate anyone bullying
my classic Japanese beauty!

03:49.295 --> 03:52.458
I asked everyone for advice,
but all they said was...

03:52.765 --> 03:54.934
Mystery Society?

03:54.934 --> 03:57.903
I'm too busy with my part-time
jobs to help with that.

03:59.105 --> 04:00.470
Not interested.

04:01.608 --> 04:04.133
Maybe now's the time to throw in the towel?

04:04.244 --> 04:05.078
Like that.

04:05.078 --> 04:07.480
This story is getting worse and worse!

04:07.480 --> 04:10.347
It truly is a harsh world we live in!

04:10.650 --> 04:12.118
What should I do?

04:12.118 --> 04:13.620
Fear not!

04:13.620 --> 04:16.556
For I, Frey, shall help you,
my dearest Japanese beauty!

04:16.556 --> 04:18.183
Leave everything to me!

04:19.892 --> 04:21.223
You'll help me?

04:21.894 --> 04:23.691
Yes! I will.

04:25.832 --> 04:28.801
So, he'll be in this class starting today.

04:28.868 --> 04:30.503
Frey Kaito

04:30.503 --> 04:32.338
Frey Kaito
I am Frey Kaito.

04:32.338 --> 04:34.306
Frey Kaito
I am most pleased to make
your acquaintance.

04:35.575 --> 04:36.837
Mr. Thief!

04:37.343 --> 04:38.810
Isn't that Frey?!

04:40.113 --> 04:43.810
My classic Japanese beauty.
As promised, I have come to help you.

04:44.517 --> 04:49.856
Today I shall join your Mystery Society
and get things into high gear!

04:49.856 --> 04:51.118
Really?!

04:51.224 --> 04:52.350
Well of course!

04:52.659 --> 04:54.360
Oh, Mr. Kaito?

04:54.360 --> 04:59.320
I'm terribly sorry, but the Mystery Society
will be dissolved very soon.

04:59.666 --> 05:04.069
Therefore, you may want to consider
joining another club.

05:04.203 --> 05:06.572
By the way, what do you mean
by "mystery" anyhow?

05:06.572 --> 05:09.976
Well, we investigate all sorts of weird
and mysterious phenomena, and...

05:09.976 --> 05:10.576
Listen to me!
Well, we investigate all sorts of weird
and mysterious phenomena, and...

05:10.576 --> 05:10.803
Listen to me!

05:11.711 --> 05:12.803
Who are you?

05:13.112 --> 05:16.081
I am Ayako Wada, president of
the student council.

05:16.582 --> 05:17.810
Student council president?

05:18.051 --> 05:19.252
So that's it?

05:19.252 --> 05:22.088
You're the scoundrel who was making
fun of my Japanese beauty!

05:22.088 --> 05:23.783
Scoundrel?

05:24.357 --> 05:27.360
I will join this Mystery Society!

05:27.360 --> 05:29.696
And it's no concern of yours, scoundrel!

05:29.696 --> 05:32.824
Besides, it hasn't been decided to
dissolve the club yet, has it?

05:34.500 --> 05:36.127
Fine.

05:36.369 --> 05:38.701
We will know the outcome soon enough.

05:40.873 --> 05:43.242
Welcome to the Mystery Society.

05:43.242 --> 05:44.834
My Japanese beauty...

05:45.478 --> 05:48.003
Right! Glad to be aboard!

05:48.114 --> 05:51.049
I was abducted
by aliens!

05:52.618 --> 05:56.076
These "strange mysteries"
are rather interesting.

05:56.656 --> 05:57.987
Go for it!

06:00.360 --> 06:02.794
Hanaoka Dadoj Tamya

06:04.397 --> 06:07.366
Take that! I call it the "600 Yen
An Hour Is Pretty Rough" shot!

06:09.035 --> 06:11.560
Yeah! You show 'em, Narugami!

06:12.638 --> 06:13.773
You see that?

06:13.773 --> 06:16.071
I've built up these legs with
all my part-time work!

06:18.745 --> 06:20.076
Thor, you rat!

06:20.813 --> 06:25.273
How dare you steal the attention
of my Japanese beauty?!

06:25.818 --> 06:28.154
In the name of the gods I shall punish you!

06:28.154 --> 06:29.519
Hey! Heads up!

06:31.290 --> 06:37.456
All right! I'll show you a shot that
will throw Thor for a loop!

06:41.267 --> 06:43.098
Give me the ball, Frey!

06:43.569 --> 06:45.304
As if I'd let you have it!

06:45.304 --> 06:46.328
Why you...

06:47.073 --> 06:48.975
You're slower than I had expected.

06:48.975 --> 06:50.408
What was that?!

06:50.576 --> 06:52.043
See you at the goal!

06:52.712 --> 06:56.478
You bastard! Nobody gets by me!

06:59.252 --> 07:01.220
Hey. The ball...

07:05.558 --> 07:06.582
Why you...

07:07.627 --> 07:09.495
My legs are getting tired.

07:09.495 --> 07:12.055
At this rate... I've got it!

07:12.732 --> 07:15.292
Whoa! They're selling beef bowls for 30% off!

07:15.468 --> 07:16.594
What?!

07:16.969 --> 07:19.233
See you later, fool!

07:26.279 --> 07:28.611
Jeez, that sucked.

07:29.315 --> 07:32.807
You shouldn't have put up such a fight.

07:32.919 --> 07:34.187
Awesome!

07:34.187 --> 07:35.848
You're number one in the class again!

07:39.392 --> 07:40.552
Top Scorers on the Mid-Term Exam
Kotaro Kakinouchi
Yuriko Takano
Hiroki Koda
Kunio Yamashita
Takafumi Urada

07:41.394 --> 07:44.022
It's not really that big a deal.

07:44.130 --> 07:46.564
Amazing! You're, like, my idol!

07:47.099 --> 07:48.828
Hey, don't fall in love with me now.

07:53.473 --> 07:55.100
What the heck?

07:55.408 --> 07:56.709
Scumbag!

07:56.709 --> 08:00.046
In order to determine who better
befits this Japanese beauty...

08:00.046 --> 08:01.638
You shall fight me!

08:01.881 --> 08:03.816
Who are you?

08:03.816 --> 08:05.647
Enough talk!

08:10.223 --> 08:11.190
Mr. Thief!

08:12.358 --> 08:13.693
What's with this guy?

08:13.693 --> 08:16.696
He's the newest member of
the Mystery Society.

08:16.696 --> 08:17.822
He's in your club?

08:18.130 --> 08:19.597
What a freak.

08:19.999 --> 08:21.667
Oh, Kotaro!

08:21.667 --> 08:22.969
Oh, my.

08:22.969 --> 08:24.436
Well, I have things to do.

08:26.372 --> 08:28.374
Mr. So-called "No. 1 in the class."

08:28.374 --> 08:32.378
My fearsomeness has scared him off!
Yes, he is the loser!

08:32.378 --> 08:33.513
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

08:33.513 --> 08:35.071
Mr. Thief!

08:38.484 --> 08:40.543
Frey's attending school?

08:41.220 --> 08:44.857
Whether it's to save the
Mystery Society or whatever,

08:44.857 --> 08:46.916
he's being a real pain in the ass.

08:47.293 --> 08:51.024
That's why Mayura isn't here today, right?

08:52.498 --> 08:54.659
You sure it's all right to leave him alone?

08:55.234 --> 08:57.361
Sure, why not?

08:57.470 --> 09:00.496
Mystery Society

09:01.340 --> 09:03.570
There you go. It should be okay now.

09:04.644 --> 09:06.271
Thank you.

09:06.913 --> 09:11.543
I'll keep these band-aids on for all
eternity, my Japanese beauty.

09:12.218 --> 09:15.354
Uh, yeah. About that...

09:15.354 --> 09:18.790
It's kind of embarrassing when you
call me your "Japanese beauty."

09:19.325 --> 09:20.986
Just plain old Mayura is fine, you know.

09:22.828 --> 09:23.954
Ah, well then.

09:24.931 --> 09:26.421
Ma...

09:26.666 --> 09:27.724
Ma...

09:28.200 --> 09:29.326
Mayu...

09:29.835 --> 09:31.735
This is so embarrassing.

09:33.406 --> 09:34.373
Yes?

09:35.308 --> 09:36.866
Oh, Wada!

09:37.276 --> 09:40.905
There's something I'd like to speak
with you about, Daidoji.

09:51.190 --> 09:54.819
I only have until next Monday?
That's so mean!

09:55.628 --> 09:57.930
I have to show you a
mysterious phenomenon?!

09:57.930 --> 09:59.432
That's right.

09:59.432 --> 10:02.435
If you really are doing what
your club professes to do,

10:02.435 --> 10:05.404
it shouldn't be too hard for you to
come up with one or two phenomena.

10:05.938 --> 10:07.929
You must have at least some ideas, right?

10:09.575 --> 10:10.872
I give up.

10:12.979 --> 10:14.469
Don't you worry.

10:16.048 --> 10:19.176
I promise I'll find you a mystery.

10:21.821 --> 10:22.845
But...

10:23.356 --> 10:26.258
Mysterious Thieves can do anything.

10:26.258 --> 10:29.557
You just sit tight and keep your chin up,
my dear Japanese beauty.

10:33.265 --> 10:35.563
Thanks, Mr. Thief!

10:35.968 --> 10:40.428
I will prepare a Grade A mystery for
my classic Japanese beauty.

11:18.744 --> 11:21.247
A mystery!

11:21.247 --> 11:23.182
Or at least it seems like that.

11:23.182 --> 11:25.150
Is this place really okay?

11:25.384 --> 11:27.147
It's all right. Just let me handle it.

11:27.953 --> 11:30.389
Now that you've brought me
all the way out here,

11:30.389 --> 11:34.155
if we don't find a mysterious
phenomenon, you're in for it!

11:34.493 --> 11:37.189
Just follow us and keep quiet, scoundrel!

11:37.663 --> 11:38.857
Whatever.

11:44.437 --> 11:48.840
Loki, are you sure it was a good
idea to bring me here?

11:49.909 --> 11:51.376
Loki...

11:52.278 --> 11:54.439
It's just the two of us...

11:55.114 --> 11:56.911
I'm so excited!

12:00.086 --> 12:04.623
Since long ago, this cave has been
feared as a home to evil spirits.

12:04.623 --> 12:06.113
Evil spirits?

12:06.726 --> 12:11.330
If anyone sets foot in here,
a horde of evil spirits will appear,

12:11.330 --> 12:13.662
and you'll be so terrified that you'll cry!

12:14.934 --> 12:16.769
What a fabulous mystery!

12:16.769 --> 12:19.966
Please. Don't even think you're
about to scare me.

12:20.206 --> 12:22.367
You're not a very nice scoundrel.

12:23.409 --> 12:25.434
Commence operation!

12:26.445 --> 12:27.878
Hurry!

12:30.382 --> 12:32.407
How did I end up doing something like this?

12:45.965 --> 12:48.801
Whoa, awesome! A pig zombie!

12:48.801 --> 12:50.428
What a mystery!

12:59.211 --> 13:02.339
I think you could do just a little bit
better with the makeup there.

13:08.521 --> 13:10.819
Huh? What's that sound?

13:23.402 --> 13:25.171
A ghost in the TV!

13:25.171 --> 13:26.195
Mystery!

13:30.709 --> 13:33.179
Nice one, Heimdall!

13:33.179 --> 13:36.171
That scoundrel is scared speechless!

13:45.958 --> 13:48.527
Such childish tricks!

13:48.527 --> 13:50.392
Shock!

13:51.263 --> 13:54.667
Either the Mystery Society has
been inactive all along,

13:54.667 --> 13:57.295
or just trying to fool people with trickery.

13:58.137 --> 14:01.436
I will be sure to report this at the
next student council meeting.

14:02.041 --> 14:04.066
You do understand, don't you?

14:07.179 --> 14:08.476
Okay, fine.

14:08.781 --> 14:10.009
My Japanese beauty!

14:10.549 --> 14:12.818
There's nothing we can do.

14:12.818 --> 14:15.981
And I can't be any more trouble
to you either, Mr. Thief.

14:16.555 --> 14:19.183
Then that means we dissolve the club.

14:20.059 --> 14:22.152
Now hold on just one minute!

14:27.399 --> 14:30.197
If that's how it's going to be,
I'll just use this!

14:30.603 --> 14:32.764
Hey, that's my concentrated evil!

14:33.172 --> 14:35.841
I'll use it to put that
scoundrel in her place!

14:35.841 --> 14:37.276
Idiot!

14:37.276 --> 14:41.303
Don't use such evil power to
threaten humans! Give it back.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.048
No deal.

14:43.048 --> 14:45.684
My most beloved woman is
in trouble right now!

14:45.684 --> 14:48.287
It's times like these when a man
must throw all else aside

14:48.287 --> 14:49.855
and help the woman he loves!

14:49.855 --> 14:51.257
Give it back already!

14:51.257 --> 14:52.519
I said no!

14:57.897 --> 14:59.398
What a disaster!

14:59.398 --> 15:02.367
Gullinbursti, go get that vial back!

15:03.569 --> 15:05.036
Mr. Thief!

15:05.571 --> 15:06.868
What's the matter?

15:07.306 --> 15:09.433
Uh... It's nothing!

15:30.062 --> 15:31.188
What is that?

15:31.964 --> 15:32.998
Loki!

15:32.998 --> 15:34.693
It's all right. Just hold on.

15:39.571 --> 15:40.906
That startled me.

15:40.906 --> 15:42.533
It seems like it's over...

15:44.910 --> 15:46.207
What's wrong?

15:53.252 --> 15:54.879
The statue of Jizo, it's...

15:55.020 --> 15:57.756
Reiya, you need to get
someplace safe right away!

15:57.756 --> 15:59.091
What about you?

15:59.091 --> 16:01.026
I'm going to where the others are.

16:01.026 --> 16:02.094
But...

16:02.094 --> 16:03.959
I'll be all right. Now hurry!

16:04.530 --> 16:07.465
Okay. Be careful, Loki!

16:21.280 --> 16:24.408
It's a strange mystery!

16:42.935 --> 16:44.129
That was close!

16:45.104 --> 16:47.072
Mystery...

16:50.242 --> 16:51.577
It's coming this way!

16:51.577 --> 16:53.272
Don't worry.

16:54.913 --> 16:56.744
Neo-Skidbladnir!

17:11.196 --> 17:13.665
That's amazing! A flying ship!

17:13.665 --> 17:15.496
Is that thing yours?

17:16.135 --> 17:17.932
Come on, we're getting on board.

17:22.574 --> 17:25.008
Frey is overdoing it!

17:44.730 --> 17:47.533
Fire the ultimate destruction beam!

17:47.533 --> 17:49.023
It doesn't have any laser beams.

17:59.578 --> 18:01.011
Here it comes!

18:01.380 --> 18:03.075
Fire the main battery!

18:08.253 --> 18:10.221
All right, you did it!

18:11.457 --> 18:13.789
Neo-Skidbladnir is invincible!

18:14.493 --> 18:16.290
Fire again!

18:29.741 --> 18:31.333
Oh no!

18:34.947 --> 18:37.643
Hang on tight, my Japanese beauty!

18:56.101 --> 18:57.227
Stop!

19:18.857 --> 19:19.983
Evil fiend!

19:27.733 --> 19:29.701
Give me a hand, Gullinbursti!

20:29.027 --> 20:30.392
Mr. Thief?

20:34.032 --> 20:36.969
I love you! Don't ever let go of me again!

20:36.969 --> 20:39.767
Whoa... Mr. Thief?

20:39.938 --> 20:41.974
My beloved...

20:41.974 --> 20:44.374
My beloved Freya.

20:45.244 --> 20:48.042
I promise I'll find you...

20:54.419 --> 20:56.853
Are you all right, Mr. Thief?

20:58.991 --> 21:02.119
Uh... yeah! I'm perfectly fine!

21:02.461 --> 21:04.622
Are you all right, my Japanese beauty?

21:05.163 --> 21:06.365
Yeah!

21:06.365 --> 21:08.595
Hey, Mr. Thief, I'm sorry.

21:09.034 --> 21:12.471
It looks like I took advantage
of your kindness.

21:12.471 --> 21:16.339
I'll find some way to keep the
Mystery Society going on my own.

21:16.975 --> 21:19.811
So you should hurry and...

21:19.811 --> 21:23.269
go find your beloved Freya.

21:24.316 --> 21:25.613
All right?

21:32.391 --> 21:33.858
I have seen the light!

21:34.126 --> 21:36.928
As long as I am president of
the student council,

21:36.928 --> 21:40.125
the Mystery Society shall
retain its club status!

21:40.365 --> 21:42.367
Mysteries are the best!

21:42.367 --> 21:44.096
Long live the mysterious!

21:44.636 --> 21:46.763
Uh... thanks.

21:56.682 --> 21:59.708
A shooting star...

22:16.968 --> 22:28.937
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.649 --> 22:42.394
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.394 --> 22:49.501
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.501 --> 22:55.941
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.941 --> 23:05.450
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.450 --> 23:09.788
Even if we're hurt

23:09.788 --> 23:21.800
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.800 --> 23:23.529
Believe in Heaven

23:31.343 --> 23:32.644
Next Episode

23:32.644 --> 23:35.781
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are,
"game," "Dracula," and "two cats, two goats."

23:35.781 --> 23:38.483
Next Episode
Hey, Kotaro, what are your hobbies?

23:38.483 --> 23:39.050
Next Episode
My hobbies?

23:39.050 --> 23:41.753
Next Episode
Yeah, you're so rich and all, I bet you
go mammoth-hunting, don't you?

23:41.753 --> 23:42.988
Next Episode
I do not!

23:42.988 --> 23:44.956
Next Episode
I do enjoy collecting little
odds and ends, though.

23:44.956 --> 23:47.192
Next Episode
Odds and ends? Oh, I know! Like the
mummified remains of water imps!

23:47.192 --> 23:49.828
Next Episode
Of course not! How the heck could
that count as "odds and ends"?!

23:49.828 --> 23:52.898
Next Episode
Odds and ends huh, huh?
Hmm, let's see then...

23:52.898 --> 23:54.966
Next Episode
And don't go looking it up in
the monster guidebook!

23:54.966 --> 23:55.734
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.734 --> 23:56.368
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.368 --> 23:56.501
The 12th Night
The Traps of Castle Dracula
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.501 --> 23:58.003
The 12th Night
The Traps of Castle Dracula
"The Traps of Castle Dracula"

23:58.003 --> 24:00.005
The 12th Night
The Traps of Castle Dracula
Sounds like another strange mystery!

24:00.005 --> 24:01.165
The 12th Night
The Traps of Castle Dracula
